board sign passage ferry schedule trader~
The Vailand Ironwind Trader carries real iron cargo on a scheduled route and
offers free work passage. Wait at this quay until it docks, then type BOARD
TRADER. While aboard, try LOOKOUT, SHIPSTATUS, and CARGOMANIFEST. At the next
port, type DISEMBARK. HELP VESSELS lists the complete player command guide.
~
